      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The University of West Alabama (UWA) is a higher-education provider in Livingston, Alabama. It provides undergraduate and postgraduate courses in over 90 fields of study. Some popular courses include Liberal Arts, Natural Sciences and Mathematics, Nursing, Technology, Business, and Education.</p><p>UWA opened in 1839 and has a long-standing reputation for providing educational opportunities to residents. But the provider has expanded to offer courses for over 4,000 students today.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
